<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.1/css/all.min.css">
    <title>Nainika Portfolio</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="my_portfolio.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/aos@next/dist/aos.css" />
    <link href='https://unpkg.com/boxicons@2.1.4/css/boxicons.min.css' rel='stylesheet'>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">


</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <div class="logo" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-duration="1000">
                <span>Nainika</span>
            </div>
            <div class="links">
                <div class="link" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="100"><a href="#home">Home</a></div>
                <div class="link" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="200"><a href="#about">About</a></div>
                <div class="link" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="400"><a href="#service">Services</a></div>
                <div class="link" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="300"><a href="#skills">Skills</a></div>   
                <div class="link contact-btn" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="600"><a href="#contactme">Contact Me</a></div>
            </div>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-bars hamburg" onclick="hamburg()"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="dropdown">
            <div class="links">
                <a href="">Home</a>
                <a href="#about">About</a>
                <a href="#services">Services</a>
                <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
                <a href="#contactme">Contact Me</a>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark cancel" onclick="cancel()"></i>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>
        <section id="home">
            <div class="main-container">
                <div class="image" data-aos="zoom-in-right" data-aos-duration="2500">
                    <img src="photo.png" alt="" width="720" height="900">
                </div>
                <div class="content">
                    <h1 data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="800">Hey I'm <span>Nainika</span></h1>
                    <div class="typewriter" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="900">I'm a <span></span></div>
                    <p data-aos="flip-up" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="1000">I am a Computer Science undergraduate, ML enthusiast, and design-driven developer. From building BCI-controlled models to leading creative projects at SIAM VIT, I love blending tech with design to craft meaningful solutions. Whether it's front-end magic, machine learning models, or graphic designing, I’m all about turning ideas into impact.
                    </p>
                    <div class="social-links" data-aos="flip-down" data-aos-duration="1000" data-aos-delay="1200">
                        <a href="https://github.com/Nainika1105/My-Portfolio" ><i class="fa-brands fa-github"></i></a>
                        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/nxinikx_1105/"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
                        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nainika-anish-74001b27a/"><i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin"></i></a>
                        <a href="#"><i class="fa-brands fa-x-twitter"></i></a>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about" id="about">
            <div class="about-img">
                <img src="pics.png">
            </div>
            <div class="about-text">
                <h2>About <span>Me</span></h2>
                <h4>Web Develope | UI UX Designer</h4>
                <p>Hey! I’m Nainika, an undergrad student at VIT University, currently pursuing Computer Science with a specialization in IoT. I’ve always been fascinated by the way technology shapes the world around us, and over time, I’ve found my passion in two areas that perfectly blend creativity and logic — machine learning and UI/UX design. I love exploring how intelligent systems work behind the scenes, and equally enjoy figuring out how to make those systems actually feel good to use. Whether it’s building an ML model or designing a smooth, intuitive interface, I like finding that balance between functionality and aesthetics. But I’m definitely not just about tech. I’m super friendly and love talking to people — whether it’s brainstorming over a group project, chatting with a new face, or just being part of something bigger than myself. I genuinely enjoy social settings and I think that’s where I grow the most, both personally and professionally. Outside of academics, I’m really active when it comes to sports and soft skills. I’ve always believed that being physically and mentally active go hand-in-hand. Whether I’m on the field or giving a presentation, I love challenging myself, working with teams, and stepping out of my comfort zone.
                    </p>

            </div>

        </section>
        <br><br><br>
        
        <section>
            <div class="service" id="service">
                <div class="container">
                    <h1 class="sub-title">My <span>Services</span></h1>
                    <div class="service-list">
                        <div>
                            <i class="bx bx-code" style="color:black"></i>
                            <h2>Web Development</h2>
                            <p>Creating responsive, engaging, and optimized websites using modern front-end tools and frameworks</p>
                            <a href="#" class="read">Learn More</a>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <i class="bx bx-crop"></i>
                            <h2>UI/UX Design</h2>
                            <p>Designing user-friendly interfaces and experiences that make apps and websites intuitive and accessible.</p>
                            <a href="#" class="read">Learn More</a>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <i class="bx bxl-apple"></i>
                            <h2>ML Prototyping</h2>
                            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Ratione quisquam recusandae ad amet corporis sit minima, fugit beatae totam nulla libero, est, dicta distinctio omnis nobis enim dolorem! Odio, adipisci?</p>
                            <a href="#" class="read">Learn More</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        
        <section class="skills" id="skills">
            <h1 class="sub-title">My <span>Skills</span></h1>

            <div class="container">
            <div class="container1" id="skills">
                <h1 class="heading1">Technical Skills</h1>
                <div class="Technical-bars">

                    <div class="bar"><i style="color: rgb(109,67, 0)" class="bx bxl-html5"></i>
                        <div class="info">
                            <span>HTML</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-line html">
                            <span></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bar"><i style="color: rgb(109,67, 0)" class="bx bxl-css3"></i>
                        <div class="info">
                            <span>CSS</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-line CSS">
                            <span></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bar"><i style="color: rgb(109,67, 0)" class="bx bxl-javascript"></i>
                        <div class="info">
                            <span>Javascript</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-line javascript">
                            <span></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bar"><i style="color: rgb(109,67, 0)" class="bx bxl-figma"></i>
                        <div class="info">
                            <span>Figma</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-line figma">
                            <span></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="container2">
                <h1 class="heading1">Professionsal Skills</h1>
                <div class="Technical-bars">

                    <div class="bar"><i style="color: rgb(109,67, 0)" class='bx bxl-creative-commons'></i>
                        <div class="info">
                            <span>Creativity</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-line creativity">
                            <span></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bar"><i style="color: rgb(109,67, 0)" class='bx bx-group'></i>
                        <div class="info">
                            <span>Teamwork</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-line teamwork">
                            <span></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bar"><i style="color: rgb(109,67, 0)" class='bx bxs-happy'></i>
                        <div class="info">
                            <span>Communication</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-line communication">
                            <span></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bar"><i style="color: rgb(109,67, 0)" class='bx bxs-time'></i>
                        <div class="info">
                            <span>Time Management</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="progress-line time">
                            <span></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>



        <section id="contactme" class="contactme">
            <h1 style="color: black"><b>Contact <span>Me</span></b></h1>
            <div class="contain">
              
              <form>
                <label for="name">Name</label>
                <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
          
                <label for="email">Email</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="Your email" required />
          
                <label for="message">Message</label>
                <textarea id="message" placeholder="Write your message here..." required></textarea>
          
                <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
              </form>
              <div class="footer">
                &copy; 2025 Nainika | Portfolio
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
          




        
        <script src="https://unpkg.com/aos@next/dist/aos.js"></script>
        <script>
          AOS.init({offset:0});
        </script>
        <script>
            function hamburg(){
                const navbar = document.querySelector(".dropdown")
                navbar.style.transform = "translateY(0px)"
            }
            function cancel(){
                const navbar = document.querySelector(".dropdown")
                navbar.style.transform = "translateY(-500px)"
            }
        </script>
</body>
</html>